      "versionNonce": 299799908,
      "isDeleted": true,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1781088948265,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "reactive -> we need to ask something then it will answer, it is not proactive, it is not\n        able to understand what should be next.\nNo memory -> there is no memory with my chatbot, if we will ask same after 3 days then we. need\n        to provide context so memory issue.\nGeneric Advice -> it is giving generic JD, but it should be our company specific.\ncan't take actions himself -> it can give JD but it can't share it in Naukri",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 8,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "reactive -> we need to ask something then it will answer, it is not proactive, it is not\n        able to understand what should be next.\nNo memory -> there is no memory with my chatbot, if we will ask same after 3 days then we. need\n        to provide context so memory issue.\nGeneric Advice -> it is giving generic JD, but it should be our company specific.\ncan't take actions himself -> it can give JD but it can't share it in Naukri",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
