      "text": "Chatbot2 -> we have provided all the docs past for jd to this chatbot, given hiring strategy\n    JD templates\n            Past JDs,  Example of high performing JD , variations for remote vs in office junior\n            vs senior.\n    Hiring Strategies\n            Best plateform for hiring, Best practices for hiring, Internal salary bond \n    Onboarding Checklist\n             Offer letter template, Welcome email template, Employee Policies\n\nNow we have improved our simple LLM based chatbot now we have RAG based chatbot.",
