      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1781088948265,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "Chatbot 3 -> Now we want our chatbot can take action from itself, not only it will draft email it will also\n    send email, not only it will draft JD, it will post also in LInkedIN or Naukri. then our work will\n    be more easy for this we will integrate tools for this\n    We will connect Chatbot3 with\n        1 LinkedIN API\n        2 Resume Parser Tool\n        3 Calender API\n        4 Mail API\n        5 HRMS tool.\n\n    these type of chatbot called as Tool Augmented Chatbot, Chatbot has power of accessing tools",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 8,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "Chatbot 3 -> Now we want our chatbot can take action from itself, not only it will draft email it will also\n    send email, not only it will draft JD, it will post also in LInkedIN or Naukri. then our work will\n    be more easy for this we will integrate tools for this\n    We will connect Chatbot3 with\n        1 LinkedIN API\n        2 Resume Parser Tool\n        3 Calender API\n        4 Mail API\n        5 HRMS tool.\n\n    these type of chatbot called as Tool Augmented Chatbot, Chatbot has power of accessing tools",
