      "text": "chatbot which is proreactive, context aware, adaptable we can call it as AI agent.\n\nWe will ask -> I want to hire a backend Engineer ->\n    Chatbot itself will understnad \n        Draft JD -> post on best plateforms\n        Monitor Pipeline -> Adjust strategy if needed\n        Screen Candidates -> Schedule interviews\n        Draft + Send offer -> start onboarding\n        \n                 \n        ",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 8,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "chatbot which is proreactive, context aware, adaptable we can call it as AI agent.\n\nWe will ask -> I want to hire a backend Engineer ->\n    Chatbot itself will understnad \n        Draft JD -> post on best plateforms\n        Monitor Pipeline -> Adjust strategy if needed\n        Screen Candidates -> Schedule interviews\n        Draft + Send offer -> start onboarding\n        \n                 \n        ",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
