      "isDeleted": true,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1781088948265,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "1. Generative AI is about creating content, Agentic AI is about solving a goal.\n2. Generating AI is reactive, Agentic AI is proactive it will everything on its own human will \n        come in between but only for approval yes or no thats it.\n3. Generative AI is building block for Agentic AI.\n4. Generative AI is capability where as Agentic AI is behaviour.",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 8,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "1. Generative AI is about creating content, Agentic AI is about solving a goal.\n2. Generating AI is reactive, Agentic AI is proactive it will everything on its own human will \n        come in between but only for approval yes or no thats it.\n3. Generative AI is building block for Agentic AI.\n4. Generative AI is capability where as Agentic AI is behaviour.",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
