      "updated": 1781089114001,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "Agenetic AI is type of AI that can make up a task or goal from a user and then work toward completing,\nit on its own, with minimal human guidance.\nIt plans, take actions, adapts to changes and seek help only when necessary.",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 8,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "Agenetic AI is type of AI that can make up a task or goal from a user and then work toward completing,\nit on its own, with minimal human guidance.\nIt plans, take actions, adapts to changes and seek help only when necessary.",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
