      "updated": 1781091176302,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "1. Autonoumous ->",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 8,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "1. Autonoumous ->",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
      "id": "7GjxZfXbfaiv50WaaKEO2",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 1159.3544502877426,
      "y": 98846.31630097446,
      "width": 1133,
      "height": 525,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1971c2",
      "backgroundColor": "#a5d8ff",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 0,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "btG",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 1416643172,
      "version": 1337,
      "versionNonce": 308507612,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1781090291731,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "Autonoumous refers to the AI System ability to make decisions and take actions on its own to \nachieve a given goal, witout needing step by step human instructions\n2. Proactive\n3. Autonomy in multiple facets ->\n    Execution\n    Decision Making\n    Tool Usage\n4 Autonomy can be controlled ->\n    a. Permission Scope -> Limit what tools or actions the agent can perform independently(You can \n            screen candidates, but need approval before rejecting anyone).\n    b. Human in the Loop(HITL) -> Insert checkpoint where human approval is required before continue\n            (Can I post this JD)\n    c. Override Controls -> Allow user to stop, pause or change the agent's behaviour at any time(Pause\n            sreening command to halt resume processing).\n    d. GuardRails/Policies -> Define hard rules  or ethical boudaries the agent must follow(Never\n            schedule interview on weekends).\n\n5. Autonomy can be dangerous ->\n    a. The application autonoumously send out job offer with incorrect salaries or terms.\n    b. the application shortlists candidates by age or nationality, violating anti-discrimination law\n    c. the application spending extra on LinkedIN ads.",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 8,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "Autonoumous refers to the AI System ability to make decisions and take actions on its own to \nachieve a given goal, witout needing step by step human instructions\n2. Proactive\n3. Autonomy in multiple facets ->\n    Execution\n    Decision Making\n    Tool Usage\n4 Autonomy can be controlled ->\n    a. Permission Scope -> Limit what tools or actions the agent can perform independently(You can \n            screen candidates, but need approval before rejecting anyone).\n    b. Human in the Loop(HITL) -> Insert checkpoint where human approval is required before continue\n            (Can I post this JD)\n    c. Override Controls -> Allow user to stop, pause or change the agent's behaviour at any time(Pause\n            sreening command to halt resume processing).\n    d. GuardRails/Policies -> Define hard rules  or ethical boudaries the agent must follow(Never\n            schedule interview on weekends).\n\n5. Autonomy can be dangerous ->\n    a. The application autonoumously send out job offer with incorrect salaries or terms.\n    b. the application shortlists candidates by age or nationality, violating anti-discrimination law\n    c. the application spending extra on LinkedIN ads.",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
      "id": "cylferCtJCeHf7Azbom5Z",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 1070.0224190377426,
      "y": 99448.16786347446,
      "width": 209,
      "height": 25,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "#a5d8ff",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
