      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1781091170965,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "2. Goal Oriented ->",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 8,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "2. Goal Oriented ->",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
      "id": "Wg3mIWZvki9re8i4nFCx3",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 1124.5458565377426,
      "y": 99483.15223847446,
      "width": 1166,
      "height": 575,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1971c2",
      "backgroundColor": "#a5d8ff",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 0,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "btI",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 234609636,
      "version": 863,
      "versionNonce": 772154460,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1781091162109,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "Being goal oriented means that the AI system operates with a persistent objective in mind and continuously\ndirects its action to achieve that objective, rather than just responding to isolated prompts.\n1. Goal acts as a compass for autonomy\n2. Goals can come with constraints\n3. Goals are stored in core memory\n    {\n      \"main_goal\" :  \"Hire a backend engineer\",\n      \"constraints\": {\n                   \"experience\" : \"2 to 4 years\",\n                   \"remote\" : true,\n                    \"stack\" : [\"Python\", \"Django\", \"Cloud\"]     \n            },\n      \"status\" :  \"active\",\n       \"created_at\" :  \"2025-06-27\",\n      \"progress\" : {\n                      \"JD_created\":true,\n                      \"posted_on\": [\"LinkedIN\", \"Naukri\"],\n                       \"application_received\": 8,\n                      \"interview_scheduled\": 2    \n                   }\n    \n    }\n4. Goals can be altered",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 8,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "Being goal oriented means that the AI system operates with a persistent objective in mind and continuously\ndirects its action to achieve that objective, rather than just responding to isolated prompts.\n1. Goal acts as a compass for autonomy\n2. Goals can come with constraints\n3. Goals are stored in core memory\n    {\n      \"main_goal\" :  \"Hire a backend engineer\",\n      \"constraints\": {\n                   \"experience\" : \"2 to 4 years\",\n                   \"remote\" : true,\n                    \"stack\" : [\"Python\", \"Django\", \"Cloud\"]     \n            },\n      \"status\" :  \"active\",\n       \"created_at\" :  \"2025-06-27\",\n      \"progress\" : {\n                      \"JD_created\":true,\n                      \"posted_on\": [\"LinkedIN\", \"Naukri\"],\n                       \"application_received\": 8,\n                      \"interview_scheduled\": 2    \n                   }\n    \n    }\n4. Goals can be altered",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
      "id": "ioADhgF9aBqHRX8SXIC8i",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 1093.0224190377426,
      "y": 100146.16786347446,
      "width": 165,
      "height": 25,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "#a5d8ff",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
