      "text": "3. Planning -> ",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 8,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "3. Planning -> ",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
      "id": "6sV9LsRc64m8S8XYBh0aO",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 1166.0380440377426,
      "y": 100170.12880097446,
      "width": 935,
      "height": 425,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1971c2",
      "backgroundColor": "#a5d8ff",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 0,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "btK",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 1376603996,
      "version": 888,
      "versionNonce": 1236313564,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1781092488787,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "planning the agent's ability to break down a high level goal into a structured seq of\nactions or subgoals and decide the best path to achieve the desired output.\n\nstep 1. Generating multiple candidate plans\n    Plan A -> Post JD on linkedin, naukri\n    Plan B -> use internal referral, hiring agencies\n\nstep 2: Evaluate each plan\n    Efficiency (which is faster)\n    Tool Availability(Which tools are available)\n    Cost(Does it require premium tool)\n    Risk (Will it fail if we get no applicants)\n    Allignment with constraints(remote-only? budget)\n\nStep 3: Select the best plan with the help of\n    Human in the loop (e.g which of these options do you prefer?)\n    A preprogrammed policy (e.g Favour low cost channels first)",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 8,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "planning the agent's ability to break down a high level goal into a structured seq of\nactions or subgoals and decide the best path to achieve the desired output.\n\nstep 1. Generating multiple candidate plans\n    Plan A -> Post JD on linkedin, naukri\n    Plan B -> use internal referral, hiring agencies\n\nstep 2: Evaluate each plan\n    Efficiency (which is faster)\n    Tool Availability(Which tools are available)\n    Cost(Does it require premium tool)\n    Risk (Will it fail if we get no applicants)\n    Allignment with constraints(remote-only? budget)\n\nStep 3: Select the best plan with the help of\n    Human in the loop (e.g which of these options do you prefer?)\n    A preprogrammed policy (e.g Favour low cost channels first)",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
      "id": "nC9O_WfJpgJz8XIS-UFSX",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 1089.0224190377426,
      "y": 100691.16786347446,
      "width": 154,
      "height": 25,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "#a5d8ff",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 0,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "btL",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 650710244,
      "version": 23,
      "versionNonce": 602458596,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1781092499493,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "4 Reasoning ->",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 8,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "4 Reasoning ->",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
      "id": "0WdxqXEDk5V4isa4lFdKA",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 1165.7802315377426,
      "y": 100731.51942597446,
      "width": 1034,
      "height": 425,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1971c2",
      "backgroundColor": "#a5d8ff",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 0,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "btM",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 9765852,
      "version": 938,
      "versionNonce": 1784792668,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1781092873878,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "the process through which an AI system interprets information, draws conclusion and make \ndecisions(both while planning and executing)\n\nExample: Phone theft scenario\n    1. interpet information -> Phone is stolen\n    2. Draw Conclusions -> Theif might misuse my number.\n    3. Make decisions -> Block number with Airtel\n\nReasoning in Planning stage -> \n    Goal Decomposition ->  Break Hire backend engineer into steps\n    Tool Selection -> Determine which tool for each step(e.g Google search for salary info)\n    resource estimation -> Time, dependency, risk\n\nResource in execution stage -> \n    Decision Making : interview 2 or 3 candidates.\n    Human in the loop ->  When to ask human vs decide independently\n    Error Handling ->  LinkedIN server down -> wait > notify human > use alternative plateform",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 8,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "the process through which an AI system interprets information, draws conclusion and make \ndecisions(both while planning and executing)\n\nExample: Phone theft scenario\n    1. interpet information -> Phone is stolen\n    2. Draw Conclusions -> Theif might misuse my number.\n    3. Make decisions -> Block number with Airtel\n\nReasoning in Planning stage -> \n    Goal Decomposition ->  Break Hire backend engineer into steps\n    Tool Selection -> Determine which tool for each step(e.g Google search for salary info)\n    resource estimation -> Time, dependency, risk\n\nResource in execution stage -> \n    Decision Making : interview 2 or 3 candidates.\n    Human in the loop ->  When to ask human vs decide independently\n    Error Handling ->  LinkedIN server down -> wait > notify human > use alternative plateform",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
