      "text": "6 Context Awareness -> ",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 8,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "6 Context Awareness -> ",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
      "id": "Mqoi6j9VgBtxc-pXBYBMu",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 1175.8896065377426,
      "y": 101491.98036347446,
      "width": 1177,
      "height": 450,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1971c2",
      "backgroundColor": "#a5d8ff",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 0,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "btS",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 1579515236,
      "version": 1132,
      "versionNonce": 611707492,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1781093963910,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "Context awareness is the agent's ability to understand, retain and utilize releavant information\nfrom the ongoing task, past interactions, user preferences and environmetal cues to make. better\ndecisions throughout a multi-step process\n\n1.Type Of Context\n    a Original Goal\n    B Progress till now + interaction history (job description was finalized and posted on LinkedIN\n            and naukri)\n    c Environment State -> Number of applicants so far = 8 or LinkedIn promotion ends in 2 days\n    d Tool Responses -> \n    e user specific preferences (prefet remote first candidates or like receiving interview \n            questions in a google Doc)\n    f policy or Guardrails -> Do not send offer without explicit user approver or never use plateform that \n            require paid ads unless approved)\n\n2. Context awareness is implement through memory -> all above detail store in memory\n3. Short term memory -> current state\n4. Long term memory -> I live in Kanpur, working in Aviso AI",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 8,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "Context awareness is the agent's ability to understand, retain and utilize releavant information\nfrom the ongoing task, past interactions, user preferences and environmetal cues to make. better\ndecisions throughout a multi-step process\n\n1.Type Of Context\n    a Original Goal\n    B Progress till now + interaction history (job description was finalized and posted on LinkedIN\n            and naukri)\n    c Environment State -> Number of applicants so far = 8 or LinkedIn promotion ends in 2 days\n    d Tool Responses -> \n    e user specific preferences (prefet remote first candidates or like receiving interview \n            questions in a google Doc)\n    f policy or Guardrails -> Do not send offer without explicit user approver or never use plateform that \n            require paid ads unless approved)\n\n2. Context awareness is implement through memory -> all above detail store in memory\n3. Short term memory -> current state\n4. Long term memory -> I live in Kanpur, working in Aviso AI",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
