      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "Components of Agentic AI System ->",
      "fontSize": 28.096875,
      "fontFamily": 8,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "Components of Agentic AI System ->",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
      "id": "KzhWWHcgXyoQtqZJ8vhEm",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 1092.9755440377426,
      "y": 102098.19716034946,
      "width": 1089,
      "height": 550,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1971c2",
      "backgroundColor": "#a5d8ff",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 0,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "btW",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 60598748,
      "version": 1343,
      "versionNonce": 204895324,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": null,
      "updated": 1781094998806,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "1 Brain -> LLM(Goal Interpretation, Planning, Reasoning, Tool Selection, Communication)\n2 Orchestrator -> LangGraph\n    this basically execute our plan, plan is created by LLM\n    task sequencing\n    conditional routing\n    retry logic\n    Looping and iteration\n    Delegation\n3 Tools\n    External tools -> perform api calls(post a job, send mail, trigger onboarding)\n    Knowledge Base access -> Retrieve factual or domain specific information using RAG or search\n            tools to ground responses.\n4 Memory\n    Short Term Memory -> Maintains the active session's context -> recent user messages, \n                tools calls and immediate decisions\n    Long Term Memory -> Persist high level goals, past interactions, user preferences and decision \n                across sessions.\n    State Tracking -> Monitors postgress, whats completed, whats pending(e.g JD posted, offer sent)\n5 Supervisor\n    Approval Request (HITL) -> Agents check with human before high risk actions(e.g sending offers)\n    Guardrails Enforcement -> Blocks unsafe or non compliant behaviour\n    Edge cased escalations -> Alert human when uncertainty/conflict arises",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 8,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "1 Brain -> LLM(Goal Interpretation, Planning, Reasoning, Tool Selection, Communication)\n2 Orchestrator -> LangGraph\n    this basically execute our plan, plan is created by LLM\n    task sequencing\n    conditional routing\n    retry logic\n    Looping and iteration\n    Delegation\n3 Tools\n    External tools -> perform api calls(post a job, send mail, trigger onboarding)\n    Knowledge Base access -> Retrieve factual or domain specific information using RAG or search\n            tools to ground responses.\n4 Memory\n    Short Term Memory -> Maintains the active session's context -> recent user messages, \n                tools calls and immediate decisions\n    Long Term Memory -> Persist high level goals, past interactions, user preferences and decision \n                across sessions.\n    State Tracking -> Monitors postgress, whats completed, whats pending(e.g JD posted, offer sent)\n5 Supervisor\n    Approval Request (HITL) -> Agents check with human before high risk actions(e.g sending offers)\n    Guardrails Enforcement -> Blocks unsafe or non compliant behaviour\n    Edge cased escalations -> Alert human when uncertainty/conflict arises",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
